    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:19472d6c-63f5-479e-9de0-57b80681cff8",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91ba3ae46b5ff6357fbe55622c5d3f9a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDD-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91ba3ae46b5ff6357fbe55622c5d3f9a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDD-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91ba3ae46b5ff6357fbe55622c5d3f9a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDD-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91ba3ae46b5ff6357fbe55622c5d3f9a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDD-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Daniel Davis",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A19472d6c-63f5-479e-9de0-57b80681cff8",
      "timeZone": "America/New_York"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: fcswa",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=1855086",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: NO",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "According to",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://java.sun.com/j2ee/tutorial/1_3-fcs/doc/Servlets12.html"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://java.sun.com/j2ee/tutorial/1_3-fcs/doc/Servlets12.html",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "...this is not a good assumption.  It can cause a long-running (over 2 seconds",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "in Tomcat, by default) API-M request to be abnormally terminated if shutdown is",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "occurring at the same time.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "------- Additional Comment #1 From Chris Wilper 2006-05-12 13:24 [reply] -------\n",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Workaround:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1) Disallow new API-M requests.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2) Wait for any existing requests to complete.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "3) Stop the server.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "For #1, this strategy should work:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "You can stop any new requests from getting through to Fedora by putting a policy",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "in play (at runtime) that temporarily restricts access to API-M and API-A.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The following policy can be used as a starting point:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.fedora.info/download/2.1.1/userdocs/server/security/xacml-policies/default/repository-wide/deny-apim-if-not-localhost.xml"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.fedora.info/download/2.1.1/userdocs/server/security/xacml-policies/default/repository-wide/deny-apim-if-not-localhost.xml",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "After putting it in the correct place, use the fedora-reload-policies tool to",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "put it into play without stopping the server:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.fedora.info/download/2.1.1/userdocs/server/cmd-line/index.html#reload"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.fedora.info/download/2.1.1/userdocs/server/cmd-line/index.html#reload",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "NOTE: Be sure to remove the \"disallow API-M\" policy before restarting the server",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "again.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Bug List: (11 of 17) First Last Prev Next   Show list      Search page      Enter new bug",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
